    <item>
      <title>En Install All Dependencies</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/Linux/yubikey/EN_Install_all_dependencies/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/Linux/yubikey/EN_Install_all_dependencies/</guid>
      <description>&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;date: 2025-10-01T12:30:21+01:00&#xA;title: &amp;ldquo;Before installing YubiKey&amp;rsquo;s ykman software&amp;rdquo;&#xA;draft: false&#xA;description: &amp;ldquo;1. Install the first dependicies on your system&amp;rdquo;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;before-you-install-ykman&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Before you install ykman&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#before-you-install-ykman&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;You will need to have the following onboard&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;apt install gnupg2 scdaemon pcscd pip pipx &#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;GnuPG — The Universal Crypto Engine&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;scdaemon - Smartcard daemon for the GnuPG system&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;pcscd - PC/SC Smart Card Daemon&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;pipx - execute binaries from Python packages in isolated environments&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>EN Yubikey Age Encryption PIV</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/Linux/yubikey/EN_Yubikey_Age_encryption_PIV/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/Linux/yubikey/EN_Yubikey_Age_encryption_PIV/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;using-age-with-a-yubikey-and-post-quantum-notes&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Using &lt;code&gt;age&lt;/code&gt; with a YubiKey (and Post-Quantum Notes)&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#using-age-with-a-yubikey-and-post-quantum-notes&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;-post-quantum-considerations&#34;&gt;&#xA;  ⚠️ Post-Quantum Considerations&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#-post-quantum-considerations&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Using age with a YubiKey is &lt;strong&gt;not post-quantum (PQ) secure&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Only manually generated age keys (depending on implementation/algorithm) can be considered PQ-resistant.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;You &lt;strong&gt;cannot import an existing age identity (private key)&lt;/strong&gt; into a YubiKey.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;A YubiKey can only &lt;strong&gt;generate and store its own keys&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;👉 If you are strictly aiming for &lt;strong&gt;post-quantum–resistant encryption&lt;/strong&gt;, a YubiKey is currently &lt;strong&gt;not the right tool&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>En Yubikey Firts Time Use</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/Linux/yubikey/EN_yubikey_firts_time_use/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/Linux/yubikey/EN_yubikey_firts_time_use/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;yubikey-bare-minimum&#34;&gt;&#xA;  YubiKey bare minimum&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#yubikey-bare-minimum&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 id=&#34;a-short-getting-started-using-the-linux-cli&#34;&gt;&#xA;  A short Getting Started Using the Linux CLI&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#a-short-getting-started-using-the-linux-cli&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Step 1 till step 8 are the absolute bare minimum you should complete before you start using your YubiKey.&#xA;If you skip these steps, there is nothing truly secure about using your YubiKey.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Hardware tokens are a powerful tool and can raise your security to a very high level—but only when used correctly.&#xA;Be aware that using hardware tokens incorrectly will not result in a more secure user environment.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Nl Yubikey Ingebruikname</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/Linux/yubikey/NL_yubikey_ingebruikname/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/Linux/yubikey/NL_yubikey_ingebruikname/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;yubikey-basisconfiguratie&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;strong&gt;YubiKey basisconfiguratie&lt;/strong&gt;&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#yubikey-basisconfiguratie&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 id=&#34;een-korte-introductie-voor-gebruik-via-de-linux-cli&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Een korte introductie voor gebruik via de Linux CLI&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#een-korte-introductie-voor-gebruik-via-de-linux-cli&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Stap 1 t/m stap 8 zijn het &lt;strong&gt;absolute minimum&lt;/strong&gt; dat je moet uitvoeren voordat je je YubiKey in gebruik neemt.&#xA;Als je deze stappen overslaat, is er &lt;strong&gt;niets echt veilig&lt;/strong&gt; aan het gebruik van je YubiKey.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Hardware-tokens zijn een krachtig hulpmiddel en kunnen je beveiliging naar een zeer hoog niveau tillen — &lt;strong&gt;maar alleen wanneer je ze correct gebruikt&lt;/strong&gt;.&#xA;Wees je ervan bewust dat hardware-tokens &lt;strong&gt;verkeerd gebruiken níét&lt;/strong&gt; resulteert in een veiliger gebruikersomgeving.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
